<h2>Appleton claim questions</h2><div class="faq"><details><summary>Part of Appleton is in Calumet County. Does that change anything?</summary><div class="a"><p>Not for the appraisal itself. Your policy terms and the damage are what matter. Local permit and code requirements can vary by municipality, and we account for those in the estimate.</p></div></details><details><summary>My carrier will only replace one side of my hail-damaged roof. Can appraisal help?</summary><div class="a"><p>If the dispute is about the amount needed to repair the covered damage, including matching, appraisal can address it. Whether matching is required may depend on policy language and Wisconsin rules.</p></div></details></div>
